  m_text: '<align="center"><size=150%><b>The original game is owned by TiMi studios,
    this project was purely made for educational purposes and does not intend to
    replace in any way the original</b>

    \n<size=140%>

    Programming:

    <align="left">-
    Just Marcy

    \n<align="center">Assets:

    <align="left">- TiMi studios/The
    pokemon company (Original owners of most art assets used)

    - ElChicoEevee
    (Unite assets mega folder)

    \n<align="center">Custom Licenses Designs:

    <align="left">-
    Just Marcy

    - Bi-derPig

    - @R_senalOgun

    \n<align="center">Custom
    Licenses Icons:

    <align="left">- Just Marcy

    - Panos

    - @R_senalOgun

    \nSpecial
    thanks to everyone at the unite mathcord for all the documentation about the
    original game mechanics'
